{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经dllhost异常网络连接。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Unusual Network Connection via DllHost。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-endpoint.events.network-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经dllhost异常网络连接","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经dllhost异常网络连接\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.microsoft.com/security/blog/2021/05/27/new-sophisticated-email-based-attack-from-nobelium/","https://www.volexity.com/blog/2021/05/27/suspected-apt29-operation-launches-election-fraud-themed-phishing-campaigns/","https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv4-special-registry/iana-ipv4-special-registry.xhtml"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"c7894234-7814-44c2-92a9-f7d851ea246a","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id, process.entity_id with maxspan=1m\n  [process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.name : \"dllhost.exe\" and process.args_count == 1]\n  [network where host.os.type == \"windows\" and process.name : \"dllhost.exe\" and\n   not cidrmatch(destination.ip, \"10.0.0.0/8\", \"127.0.0.0/8\", \"169.254.0.0/16\", \"172.16.0.0/12\", \"192.0.0.0/24\",\n    \"192.0.0.0/29\", \"192.0.0.8/32\", \"192.0.0.9/32\", \"192.0.0.10/32\", \"192.0.0.170/32\", \"192.0.0.171/32\", \"192.0.2.0/24\",\n    \"192.31.196.0/24\", \"192.52.193.0/24\", \"192.168.0.0/16\", \"192.88.99.0/24\", \"224.0.0.0/4\", \"100.64.0.0/10\",\n    \"192.175.48.0/24\", \"198.18.0.0/15\", \"198.51.100.0/24\", \"203.0.113.0/24\", \"240.0.0.0/4\", \"::1\", \"FE80::/10\",\n    \"FF00::/8\")]\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":214,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
